Parfait. J'ai maintenant toutes les informations necessaires pour concevoir un plan d'implementation complet. Voici mon analyse et le plan detaille.

---

## Plan d'Implementation : Navigation Sidebar Patient Moodday

### Resume de l'analyse

**Patterns existants identifies :**
1. La navigation utilise le systeme `SidebarProvider` + `Sidebar` + `SidebarInset` de Shadcn/UI
2. Les liens de navigation sont definis via une fonction `getXNavigation(t: Translator)` retournant des `NavigationGroup[]`
3. Le composant sidebar utilise `variant="inset"` avec header, content, footer et rail
4. TailwindCSS v4 utilise `@theme inline` dans `globals.css` pour les tokens de design

**Structure cible :**
- Les pages patient dans `(logged-in)/` (dashboard, medications, exercises, etc.) ont besoin d'un layout avec sidebar
- Le layout ne doit PAS affecter le layout `(account-layout)` existant

---

### Etape 1 : Ajouter les tokens de design Moodday dans globals.css

**Fichier a modifier :** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/globals.css`

**Tokens a ajouter dans `@theme inline` :**
```css
/* Moodday Design System */
--color-moodday-teal: #2BA09F;
--color-moodday-sage: #48A878;
--color-moodday-lavender: #D4C5E8;
--color-moodday-bg-warm: #F8F7F3;
--color-moodday-bg-warm-alt: #F4F1ED;
```

**Nouveaux tokens CSS a ajouter dans `:root` :**
```css
/* Patient sidebar specific */
--sidebar-patient: #F8F7F3;
--sidebar-patient-accent: rgba(43, 160, 159, 0.1);
--sidebar-patient-primary: #2BA09F;
```

**Classes utilitaires a ajouter dans `@layer utils` :**
```css
.glass-card {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
}

.blob-decoration {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  filter: blur(80px);
  opacity: 0.3;
  z-index: -1;
}
```

---

### Etape 2 : Creer le dossier de navigation patient

**Nouveau dossier :** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/(logged-in)/_navigation/`

**Fichiers a creer :**
1. `patient-navigation.links.ts` - Configuration des liens
2. `patient-sidebar.tsx` - Composant sidebar client
3. `patient-navigation.tsx` - Wrapper async server
4. `patient-mobile-nav.tsx` - Navigation mobile (barre du bas)

---

### Etape 3 : Creer la configuration des liens (patient-navigation.links.ts)

```typescript
import type { NavigationGroup } from "@/features/navigation/navigation.type";
import { 
  LayoutDashboard, 
  Pill, 
  Activity, 
  SmilePlus, 
  Settings, 
  MessageSquare, 
  FileDown,
  BarChart3,
  Users
} from "lucide-react";

type Translator = (key: string, values?: Record<string, string | number>) => string;

export const getPatientNavigation = (t: Translator): NavigationGroup[] => {
  return [
    {
      title: t("patient.nav.main"),
      links: [
        { href: "/dashboard", Icon: LayoutDashboard, label: t("nav.dashboard") },
        { href: "/mood", Icon: SmilePlus, label: t("patient.nav.mood") },
      ],
    },
    {
      title: t("patient.nav.tracking"),
      links: [
        { href: "/medications", Icon: Pill, label: t("patient.nav.medications") },
        { href: "/exercises", Icon: Activity, label: t("patient.nav.exercises") },
        { href: "/therapy", Icon: MessageSquare, label: t("patient.nav.therapy") },
      ],
    },
    {
      title: t("patient.nav.tools"),
      links: [
        { href: "/export", Icon: FileDown, label: t("patient.nav.export") },
        { href: "/settings", Icon: Settings, label: t("settings.title") },
      ],
    },
  ];
};

// Pour la navigation mobile (5 items max)
export const getPatientMobileNavigation = (t: Translator) => [
  { href: "/dashboard", Icon: LayoutDashboard, label: t("nav.dashboard") },
  { href: "/mood", Icon: SmilePlus, label: t("patient.nav.mood") },
  { href: "/medications", Icon: Pill, label: t("patient.nav.medications") },
  { href: "/exercises", Icon: Activity, label: t("patient.nav.exercises") },
  { href: "/settings", Icon: Settings, label: t("settings.title") },
];
```

---

### Etape 4 : Creer le composant PatientSidebar (patient-sidebar.tsx)

**Pattern a suivre :** Copier la structure de `app-sidebar.tsx` avec adaptations :
- Logo Moodday dans le header (icone coeur/humeur)
- Nom de l'app "Moodday"
- Style glass-card optionnel
- Memes composants : `ItemCollapsing`, `SidebarNavigationMenu`, `SidebarUserButton`

```typescript
"use client";

import { Typography } from "@/components/nowts/typography";
import {
  Sidebar, SidebarContent, SidebarFooter, SidebarGroup,
  SidebarGroupContent, SidebarGroupLabel, SidebarHeader, SidebarRail,
} from "@/components/ui/sidebar";
import { SidebarNavigationMenu } from "@/components/ui/sidebar-utils";
import { SidebarUserButton } from "@/features/sidebar/sidebar-user-button";
import { useI18n } from "@/i18n/provider";
import { Heart, ChevronDown } from "lucide-react";
import { usePathname } from "next/navigation";
import { useEffect, useState, PropsWithChildren } from "react";
import { getPatientNavigation } from "./patient-navigation.links";

export function PatientSidebar() {
  const { t } = useI18n();
  const links = getPatientNavigation(t);

  return (
    <Sidebar variant="inset" className="bg-[var(--sidebar-patient)]">
      <SidebarHeader className="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div className="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5">
          <div className="bg-[#2BA09F] text-white flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg">
            <Heart className="size-4" />
          </div>
          <Typography variant="large">Moodday</Typography>
        </div>
      </SidebarHeader>
      <SidebarContent>
        {links.map((link) => (
          <ItemCollapsing defaultOpenStartPath={link.defaultOpenStartPath} key={link.title}>
            <SidebarGroup>
              <SidebarGroupLabel asChild>
                <CollapsibleTrigger>
                  {link.title}
                  <ChevronDown className="ml-auto transition-transform group-data-[state=open]/collapsible:rotate-180" />
                </CollapsibleTrigger>
              </SidebarGroupLabel>
              <CollapsibleContent>
                <SidebarGroupContent>
                  <SidebarNavigationMenu link={link} />
                </SidebarGroupContent>
              </CollapsibleContent>
            </SidebarGroup>
          </ItemCollapsing>
        ))}
      </SidebarContent>
      <SidebarFooter className="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <SidebarUserButton />
      </SidebarFooter>
      <SidebarRail />
    </Sidebar>
  );
}

// ItemCollapsing identique a app-sidebar.tsx
```

---

### Etape 5 : Creer la navigation mobile (patient-mobile-nav.tsx)

Composant de barre de navigation fixe en bas pour mobile avec 5 icones :

```typescript
"use client";

import { useI18n } from "@/i18n/provider";
import { usePathname } from "next/navigation";
import Link from "next/link";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
import { getPatientMobileNavigation } from "./patient-navigation.links";

export function PatientMobileNav() {
  const { t } = useI18n();
  const pathname = usePathname();
  const items = getPatientMobileNavigation(t);

  return (
    <nav className="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-t bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-lg md:hidden">
      <div className="flex h-16 items-center justify-around px-2">
        {items.map((item) => {
          const isActive = pathname === item.href;
          return (
            <Link
              key={item.href}
              href={item.href}
              className={cn(
                "flex flex-col items-center gap-1 px-3 py-2 text-xs transition-colors",
                isActive ? "text-[#2BA09F]" : "text-muted-foreground"
              )}
            >
              <item.Icon className={cn("size-5", isActive && "text-[#2BA09F]")} />
              <span>{item.label}</span>
            </Link>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </nav>
  );
}
```

